### Irrigation footprint pipeline ###
# Downloaded and derived data never go to git (CLAUDE.md); only the legacy
# Spring demo data generator stays tracked until server/ is retired
/data/*
!/data/csv/
!/data/sql_generator.py
# Credentials: .env is ignored above, its template is tracked
.env.*
!.env.example
